  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Front Line Defenders 2019-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Front Line Defender&apos;s programme aims to ensure that human rights defenders are recognized and supported as essential actors in defending and advancing human rights and the realisation of Agenda 2030, including the commitment to leaving no-one behind. The main target group is human rights defenders and human rights organisations at risk in developing countries, supporting them to safely continue their essential work to promote human rights in their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
